# .gitignore for the SOM/VIP sharpen/dampen release.
#
# The four trained checkpoints — phaseA_somvip/ckpt_circuit_sharpen.pt,
# phaseA_somvip/ckpt_circuit_dampen.pt, phaseA_somvip/ckpt_momentum.pt, and
# phaseB_somvip/ckpt_ctxswitch_seed1.pt — ARE the durable result of this package and are
# committed deliberately as part of the release, so a fresh clone ships with the trained
# nets ready to run. This repo has no blanket `*.pt` ignore, so regenerated or scratch
# checkpoints are NOT auto-ignored: write them elsewhere via each script's `--out` flag
# (e.g. `grid_circuit.py --out grid_output`, `train_switch.py --out <path>`) so you never
# overwrite the shipped checkpoints.

# Keep the usual Python noise out of the package.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
